---

{/* Site-name markup: Landing only renders on the locale home pages, so this is
    the one place Google should see a WebSite entity. */}
<SiteJsonLd locale={locale} />

<div class="lp not-content">
	<!-- scene stack: hero -> quickstart -> horizontal rail. Each wrapper owns a
	     named view-timeline; its sticky inner stage pins under the pill header
	     while the next scene rides over it (motion.md sticky stacking +
	     scale-depth morph). -->
	<div class="lp-scenes">
	<section class="lp-scene lp-scene-hero">
	<div class="lp-scene-inner lp-hero-field">
		<div class="lp-field-bg" aria-hidden="true">
			<Image src={heroFieldLight} alt="" class="lp-field-light" loading="eager" widths={[1024, 2048]} sizes="100vw" />
			<Image src={heroFieldDark} alt="" class="lp-field-dark" loading="lazy" widths={[1024, 2048]} sizes="100vw" />
		</div>
		<div class="lp-hero-copy">
			{/* Product-word drum: the H1 performs the claim — the proxy serves both
			    Codex and Claude Code. 4-face rotateX cylinder, fixed slot width via
			    inline-grid stacking; reduced-motion collapses to a static pairing. */}
			<h1 id="_top">
				{t('Run ', '', '让 ', 'Запускайте ', '実行 ', '讓 ', '')}<span class="lp-drum" aria-label="Codex and Claude">
					<span class="lp-drum-spin" aria-hidden="true">
						<span class="lp-drum-face lp-drum-codex">Codex</span>
						<span class="lp-drum-face lp-drum-claude">Claude</span>
						<span class="lp-drum-face lp-drum-codex">Codex</span>
						<span class="lp-drum-face lp-drum-claude">Claude</span>
					</span>
					<span class="lp-drum-static" aria-hidden="true">Codex<span class="lp-drum-dot"> · </span>Claude</span>
				</span>{t(' on any LLM.', '를 어떤 LLM 위에서든.', ' 跑在任意 LLM 上。', ' на любой LLM.', ' を任意の LLM 上で。', ' 跑在任意 LLM 上。', ' dilediğiniz LLM ile çalıştırın.')}
			</h1>
			<p class="lp-sub">
				{t('opencodex is a local proxy that serves Codex and Claude Code from one port — translating each wire format to any provider, with streaming, tool calls, reasoning, and images in both directions. Zero client patches.', 'opencodex는 포트 하나로 Codex와 Claude Code를 함께 서빙하는 로컬 프록시입니다 — 각 wire 포맷을 어떤 프로바이더로든 양방향 변환하고, 스트리밍·tool call·reasoning·이미지까지 그대로 통과시킵니다. 클라이언트 패치는 없습니다.', 'opencodex 是一个本地代理，用同一个端口同时服务 Codex 与 Claude Code —— 将各自的线路格式双向翻译为任意 provider，支持流式、工具调用、推理与图像。无需修补客户端。', 'opencodex — локальный прокси, который обслуживает Codex и Claude Code через один порт: транслирует каждый wire-формат под любого провайдера, пропуская стриминг, вызовы инструментов, рассуждения и изображения в обе стороны. Никаких патчей на стороне клиента.', 'opencodex は 1 つのポートで Codex と Claude Code をまとめて提供するローカルプロキシです — 各 wire フォーマットを任意のプロバイダーへ双方向に変換し、ストリーミング・ツール呼び出し・推論・画像までそのまま通します。クライアントのパッチは不要です。', 'opencodex 是一個本機代理，用同一個連接埠同時服務 Codex 與 Claude Code —— 將各自的線路格式雙向翻譯為任意供應商，支援流式、工具呼叫、推理與圖像。無需修補用戶端。', 'opencodex, Codex ve Claude Code’u tek bir port üzerinden sunan yerel bir proxy’dir — her bir hat formatını dilediğiniz sağlayıcıya dönüştürür; akış (streaming), araç çağrıları (tool calls), akıl yürütme (reasoning) ve görseller her iki yönde de sorunsuz iletilir. İstemci tarafında sıfır yama.')}
			</p>
			<div class="lp-cta">
				<a class="lp-btn-primary" href={`${prefix}getting-started/installation/`}>
					{t('Get Started', '시작하기', '快速开始', 'Начать', 'はじめに', '快速入門', 'Başlarken')}
					<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="14" height="14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
				</a>
				<a class="lp-btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/lidge-jun/opencodex">GitHub</a>
			</div>
		<ul class="lp-chips" aria-label={t('Supported providers', '지원 프로바이더', '支持的 provider', 'Поддерживаемые провайдеры', '対応プロバイダー', '支援的供應商', 'Desteklenen sağlayıcılar')}>
				{providers.map((p) => (
					<li>
						{p.path && (
							<svg class="lp-chip-mark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
								<path d={p.path} />
							</svg>
						)}
						{p.label}
